  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n⇒ frac{{32}}{{46}} × frac{{94}}{{576}} × frac{{184}}{{282}}\n\n**CONCEPT USED:**\n\nProduct of fractions.\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ (32/46) x (94/576) x (184/282)\n\n⇒ (32/576) x (94/282) x (184/46)\n\n⇒ (1/18) × (1/3) × (4/1)\n\n⇒ (4/18) × (1/3) \n\n⇒ (2/9) × (1/3) \n\n⇒ 2/27\n\n**∴ The value of frac{{32}}{{46}} × frac{{94}}{{576}} × frac{{184}}{{282}} will be (2/27).**\n\n13",
